The '''KX9 laser cannon''',<ref name="SWCT X-wing" /> also known as the '''KX-9 Laser Cannon''',<ref name="GoH">''[[Star Wars: Galaxy of Heroes]]''</ref> was a [[laser cannon]] manufactured by the [[Taim & Bak]] company. The KX9 laser cannon consisted of four parts; the laser cannon, laser barrel, flashback suppressor, and the laser tip. [[T-65B X-wing starfighter]]s utilized four KX9 laser cannons, one at the end of each [[S-foils|S-foil]],<ref name="SWCT X-wing" /> and the [[Delta-class T-3c shuttle|''Delta''-class T-3c shuttle]] was equipped with two twin KX-9s.<ref name="R1VG" />

